Qt 6.12.0 QtQml generator GC fixes (ABI-preserving backport)

Upstream: 7d5e24963a82dd6dc7419fc2f943042db2598bde
Upstream: 9eca4322acef46f67405e891d9a61661a4fc26ee
Base: 4332fbbb4c340463dc8cee36dda0c85d932122d8 (Qt 6.12.0 SDK SPDX)

Keep Value::mark(MarkStack *) non-const so untouched QtQuick binaries retain
all existing private ABI imports. markJSFrame uses mutable views of its existing
frame; the GC marking algorithm and null guard are unchanged from upstream.
Upstream regression cases are adapted in tests/qt/qv4-gc/Qv4GcTest.cpp.
Qt source retains its original copyright and SPDX license expressions.

